# Root-level reference only: this project has no root-level service of its
# own. Copy each services/*/.env.example to services/*/.env and fill in real
# values (same JWT_SECRET and GATEWAY_SECRET in all four; DB_USER/DB_PASSWORD
# matching your EXISTING local MySQL login for blood_bank_db).
#
# Generate strong secrets with:
#   node -e "console.log(require('crypto').randomBytes(48).toString('hex'))"
